				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Sky): Add SimpleIcons to tech stack badges in README\n\nReplace plain text tech stack badges with branded SVG icons from SimpleIcons. Each badge now displays a colored icon (Astro purple, Effect-TS violet) adjacent to its version badge, improving visual recognition of the technologies used.\n\nThis aligns with modern open-source documentation aesthetics and helps users quickly identify the tech stack at a glance.",
